# Visual Imagery EEG Dataset

## Overview

This dataset contains EEG recordings collected from 22 participants performing visual imagery (VI) tasks involving three categories: animals, figures, and objects. Each subject participated in two sessions (ses-01, ses-02), where they were instructed to vividly imagine the corresponding visual stimuli. The dataset is organized according to the EEG-Brain Imaging Data Structure (EEG-BIDS), ensuring standardization and compatibility with neuroimaging tools.
Note: Subjects sub-09 and sub-10 only completed ses-01 due to personal reasons and therefore do not have data for ses-02.


## Dataset Structure

The dataset is organized as follows:
VI-EEG/
│── coordsystem.json          
│── dataset_description.json   # Metadata about the dataset
│── electrodes.tsv         # EEG electrodes used in the dataset
│── participants.tsv           # Subject metadata (age, gender, etc.)
│── participants.json          # Description of participants.tsv fields
│── README.md                  # Dataset documentation
│── task-AVI_events.json   
│── task-FVI_events.json
│── task-OVI_events.json
│
├── sub-01/  # Raw EEG data 
│   ├── ses-01/
│   │   ├──eeg/
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-01_task-AVI_channels.tsv 
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-01_task-AVI_eeg.bdf # Raw EEG data (bdf format)
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-01_task-AVI_eeg.json
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-02_task-AVI_events.tsv  # Event markers (onset, duration, type, etc.)
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-01_task-FVI_channels.tsv 
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-01_task-FVI_eeg.bdf 
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-01_task-FVI_eeg.json
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-02_task-FVI_events.tsv  
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-01_task-OVI_channels.tsv 
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-01_task-OVI_eeg.bdf 
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-01_task-OVI_eeg.json
│   │   │   ├── sub-01_ses-02_task-OVI_events.tsv  
│   ├── ses-02/
│   │   ├──eeg/
│   │   │   ├── ...
